        "heading": "We didn't invent hydration science. We just made it gut-friendly.",
        "text": "<p>Tiiga is built on ORS, or Oral Rehydration Solution: a specific balance of electrolytes and glucose designed to help your body absorb water more efficiently. We use that same science — plus prebiotic baobab fiber — with real ingredients and refreshing flavors for everyday hydration.</p>",
